# ***`cfg' COMES FIRST AND `.' IS NOT ON THE LIST AT ALL.***
# The four hand-kept headers are reached by three different spellings
# -- `<main/php_config.h>' from `TSRM/TSRM.h:20', `<php_config.h>'
